{"id":"n4381b7f7de","headline":"Jobless jump turns down heat on RBA, but not completely","summary":"Australia's unemployment rate has reached a five-year high, reducing pressure on the central bank. Inflation data due in October will be decisive for the Reserve Bank's next move.","why":"The Reserve Bank of Australia sets the country's cash rate, which drives borrowing costs and the Australian dollar. Unemployment and inflation data are its main inputs for rate decisions.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Sydney","country":"Australia","lat":-33.87,"lon":151.21,"region":"oc"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"queanbeyanage.com.au","url":"https://www.queanbeyanage.com.au/story/9368820/misery-on-the-march-as-jobs-market-slowly-unwinds/"},"sources":[{"name":"queanbeyanage.com.au","url":"https://www.queanbeyanage.com.au/story/9368820/misery-on-the-march-as-jobs-market-slowly-unwinds/"}],"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:15:14Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"b081a7f32b287365","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-15T06:15:14Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-14T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/central-bank-building-4584690.jpg","alt":"central bank building (illustration)","credit":"Makalu","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/tajikistan-iskanderkul-alexandersee-4584690/"}}